1
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:10,580
Don’t toss things around.

2
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,830
That one’s clean.

3
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:14,000
So, how did it go?

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,290
She promised she won't interfere with Rourou's affairs.

5
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:21,460
At least, that’s what she claims.

6
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,290
What if she’s—

7
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:24,710
—pulling something behind our backs?

8
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,170
Zhou Qin doesn’t seem like

9
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,750
someone you can easily threaten.

10
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:31,710
It all comes down to who’s holding the better cards.

11
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:34,830
She won’t dare make a move anytime soon.

12
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,460
Pan Hao already used Ah-Biao against her.

13
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,330
She’s probably busy right now—

14
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,330
dealing with that guy

15
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,290
No time to worry about us.

16
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:43,130
But now that you’ve shown your hand—

17
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:45,540
we can’t let our guard down.

18
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:47,000
I know

19
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,250
This fight’s not over yet.

20
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,540
Guys—

21
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:53,380
we’re just getting started, okay?

22
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:01,000
Hey—

23
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,540
there’s something I don’t get.

24
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,500
Why are we busting our asses?

25
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,039
The diamonds aren’t even ours.

26
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:16,960
When you put it that way… you’ve got a point.

27
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,500
Right?

28
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,080
Wait, I got it—

29
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:23,880
Since you guys have my back,

30
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:26,250
I’ll split it with you—

31
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,130
half a diamond each.

32
00:01:27,130 --> 00:01:28,170
Fair enough?

33
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:30,960
No…

34
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:34,830
That’s enough, you guys -

35
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:36,460
coming to work or not?

36
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:38,170
it's time to get ready

37
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:39,039
come on

38
00:01:39,039 --> 00:01:40,250
You guys live together every day—

39
00:01:40,250 --> 00:01:41,210
still got that much to talk about?

40
00:01:41,210 --> 00:01:42,539
Save it for downstairs.

41
00:01:42,539 --> 00:01:43,460
Got it, Tony.

42
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,330
Let’s go, time to work.

43
00:01:45,330 --> 00:01:47,920
You go ahead—we want the diamonds.

44
00:01:48,789 --> 00:01:51,039
Work first.

45
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:51,830
I love work.

46
00:01:51,830 --> 00:01:52,880
You’ve got zero social skills.

47
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:56,380
Is your sister doing better?

48
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:57,420
She’s out of the hospital.

49
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,830
Then...

50
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:02,330
have you thought about

51
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:04,170
what I said before?

52
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:07,250
I really like you.

53
00:02:07,250 --> 00:02:10,630
I’m not asking you to take care of me.

54
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:12,540
I ask for nothing

55
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:14,790
If you’re willing—

56
00:02:14,790 --> 00:02:16,380
Shall we give it a try?

57
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:20,380
You…

58
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:22,380
why do you like me so much?

59
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:27,000
Love’s just a feeling.

60
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,750
If you can explain it—

61
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,380
it’s not love.

62
00:02:37,790 --> 00:02:38,920
When I was a kid…

63
00:02:40,790 --> 00:02:42,670
that woman left me and my sister—

64
00:02:42,670 --> 00:02:44,540
at the orphanage

65
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:46,130
and said she’d come back for us.

66
00:02:52,170 --> 00:02:53,500
Brother…

67
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:56,920
didn’t Mom say she’d come back?

68
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:59,040
The sun’s almost down…

69
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:01,170
why isn’t she here yet?

70
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,540
Why are you so hot—

71
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,790
you’ve got a fever.

72
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,040
Teacher, my sister has a fever!

73
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,750
Can you help us?

74
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,540
I’ll do anything—

75
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:20,420
clean, carry water bucket—anything!

76
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:22,380
Please help my sister…

77
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:43,130
What the hell…?

78
00:04:04,250 --> 00:04:05,790
Here's your order.

79
00:04:05,790 --> 00:04:07,790
What took you so long? It’s cold already.

80
00:04:07,790 --> 00:04:09,670
Sorry, the GPS kept disconnecting in the mountains—

81
00:04:09,670 --> 00:04:10,670
I couldn’t find the way.

82
00:04:10,670 --> 00:04:11,790
I’m really sorry.

83
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:13,670
Unbelievable. I’m leaving a bad review.

84
00:04:25,630 --> 00:04:27,420
Bro, tomorrow I want—

85
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:29,290
that strawberry cake by the hospital.

86
00:04:29,290 --> 00:04:31,290
It looks so cute.

87
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,670
Sure, I got it!

88
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,420
Hey, Hsu—

89
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,290
Da

90
00:04:46,290 --> 00:04:50,000
Take a break if you're tired

91
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,130
Three night shifts in a row.

92
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:53,000
Right?

93
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
It’s fine

94
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,540
I can handle it.

95
00:04:56,540 --> 00:04:58,540
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

96
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,880
New drink - Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

97
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:04,130
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

98
00:05:04,130 --> 00:05:06,790
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free.Thank you.

99
00:05:27,790 --> 00:05:30,750
(Hsu Xiaoxi—heart check-up fee due next week)

100
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:42,540
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

101
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:43,290
Take a look

102
00:05:43,290 --> 00:05:45,750
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free. Check it out

103
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:47,670
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

104
00:05:47,670 --> 00:05:49,420
Mango Double Q, buy one get one free

105
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:51,380
Very delicious

106
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:52,920
Thank you

107
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,420
Mom, I want the drink

108
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,880
Okay, Mom will get it for you

109
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:03,000
If that woman hadn’t left…

110
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,630
would we be able to —

111
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:06,630
simply walking together like them

112
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,040
Did you ever try to find her?

113
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:22,290
Why would I?

114
00:06:22,290 --> 00:06:23,670
She left us

115
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:25,670
when we needed her most

116
00:06:25,670 --> 00:06:28,750
Even if she showed up now—

117
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:31,170
I wouldn’t even look at her.

118
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:35,170
After that—

119
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,630
I trusted no one.

120
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:44,630
No emotional attachments.

121
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,920
So...

122
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
I don’t know if I can love someone properly.

123
00:07:02,170 --> 00:07:05,250
You’ll never know

124
00:07:05,250 --> 00:07:07,250
if you don’t try—

125
00:08:24,790 --> 00:08:25,790
Sister Qin

126
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:30,290
Seems like,

127
00:08:30,290 --> 00:08:32,789
being with Ah-Biao didn’t help you much.

128
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,250
I’ve got a deal—

129
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:44,039
one that gets you out from under him.

130
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:49,500
So?

131
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,790
You in or not?

132
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,790
I've taken care of Zhou Qin.

133
00:09:30,790 --> 00:09:34,380
From now on, you don’t have to be afraid anymore.

134
00:09:36,250 --> 00:09:38,630
I want Sun Rourou set free.

135
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,420
I made her what she is.

136
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:48,670
What give you the right to ask for her freedom?

137
00:09:48,670 --> 00:09:50,670
"Right"?

138
00:09:50,670 --> 00:09:52,920
Then let me ask Chiang

139
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:56,920
If he gets his hands on this photo I have…

140
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,540
…and finds out you’ve been working with Ah-Biao—

141
00:10:01,750 --> 00:10:04,670
I wonder what kind of “right” he would give me.

142
00:10:22,170 --> 00:10:23,420
Thank you.

143
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,540
I ordered take-out delivery for you.

144
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:03,250
It’ll be here soon.

145
00:11:03,250 --> 00:11:04,790
Make sure you eat something.

146
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,380
Here—

147
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:15,250
Keep it on you for protection.

148
00:11:15,250 --> 00:11:16,880
While I’m gone these next few days,

149
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,630
you need to be careful.

150
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:21,540
If anything happens—

151
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,040
call me right away.

152
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:32,750
Is stealing a few diamonds really that hard?

153
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:37,170
Because of you - useless piece of trash

154
00:12:37,170 --> 00:12:40,750
I have to keep putting up with Chao De-chiang!

155
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:42,170
How much longer do I have to endure this?!

156
00:12:42,170 --> 00:12:46,170
How much longer?

157
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:52,750
Biao, please help me!

158
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:55,000
I’ll work hard to pay you back!

159
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,290
Please...

160
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:59,880
Ah-Jun

161
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:03,380
Do you even know how much you owe me?

162
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,040
You couldn’t pay it back in a lifetime.

163
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:21,000
How about you go grab Lee Xun for me

164
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,420
You can’t steal diamonds but you can catch someone, right?

165
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,500
Why can’t I—

166
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:31,170
take Chao De-chiang down?

167
00:13:35,170 --> 00:13:37,540
I’ve been wondering…

168
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:41,040
why have my guys been so useless lately?

169
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:44,920
Can’t even take out a guy like Lee Xun.

170
00:13:49,380 --> 00:13:51,670
Turns out…

171
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:54,040
someone wants him alive

172
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,630
Wanna take me out?

173
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,670
Boss Chiang—

174
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:02,540
This is a misunderstanding! It's not what you think!

175
00:14:02,540 --> 00:14:03,790
A misunderstanding?

176
00:14:05,250 --> 00:14:07,420
What, am I hard of hearing?

177
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:10,540
Didn’t you just say it yourself?

178
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:11,790
What exactly did I misunderstand?

179
00:14:19,540 --> 00:14:20,920
Let me explain!

180
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:21,790
Boss Chiang, please—

181
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:23,290
give me a chance to explain!

182
00:14:24,130 --> 00:14:26,290
You know what?

183
00:14:26,290 --> 00:14:29,170
What I hate most in life—

184
00:14:29,170 --> 00:14:31,540
are traitors who bite the hand that feeds them.

185
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,750
Wait...

186
00:14:40,790 --> 00:14:43,630
Ah-Biao—

187
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:47,670
even dogs are more loyal than you.

188
00:14:49,670 --> 00:14:51,920
Boss, are you okay?!

189
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,540
Quick—take him out!

190
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:55,420
Move! Now!

191
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:30,790
Tony

192
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:35,790
Good work.

193
00:15:44,170 --> 00:15:45,170
Lily

194
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,670
Where are my

195
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,880
Coming right up!

196
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:16,040
Pretty grand and classy, right?

197
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,420
Tonight, we’re going all out.

198
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,290
Chenghan, check it out—

199
00:17:24,290 --> 00:17:25,500
take a look at this suit—

200
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:26,670
plus the necklace—

201
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:29,250
perfect finishing touch. I look stunning.

202
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:30,750
Let me get a better look—turn around.

203
00:17:32,170 --> 00:17:34,670
Nice. You look best from the back.

204
00:17:39,670 --> 00:17:40,540
Idiot

205
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,040
Zhou Qin

206
00:19:47,750 --> 00:19:48,750
Welcome

207
00:19:48,750 --> 00:19:49,880
welcome to Ace

208
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,290
Come in, please

209
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:52,540
enjoy the show

210
00:19:58,290 --> 00:19:59,170
Miss Lin

211
00:19:59,170 --> 00:20:00,250
Welcome

212
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:04,290
Ms. Lin, welcome.

213
00:20:04,290 --> 00:20:08,040
Haven’t seen you in days—you’re looking even better.

214
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,420
Where's Justin?

215
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:11,750
He's backstage, on standby

216
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:13,540
Big show tonight.

217
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,920
You ladies are in for a treat.

218
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:16,880
This way, please.

219
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,420
Let's go.

220
00:20:19,670 --> 00:20:20,880
enjoy the show

221
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:37,130
Chiang

222
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:38,500
welcome to ACE

223
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:40,040
Welcome.

224
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,630
Not bad.

225
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:43,130
Just what I’d expect from Uncle Ma’s place.

226
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:51,750
Qin

227
00:20:52,790 --> 00:20:54,670
Welcome, welcome.

228
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,790
You know each other?

229
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,880
We...

230
00:21:06,670 --> 00:21:07,670
of course,

231
00:21:07,670 --> 00:21:10,040
Qin is our old—

232
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,790
—friend.

233
00:21:16,290 --> 00:21:17,920
Regular?

234
00:21:19,500 --> 00:21:21,670
Not really...

235
00:21:21,670 --> 00:21:24,130
I come with friends sometimes—

236
00:21:24,130 --> 00:21:27,290
for birthdays, that’s all.

237
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:32,380
What are you waiting for?

238
00:21:32,380 --> 00:21:34,130
Aren’t you going to invite us in?

239
00:21:34,130 --> 00:21:35,040
Sorry about that.

240
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:36,380
Please, go ahead.

241
00:21:38,750 --> 00:21:40,040
enjoy the show

242
00:21:55,630 --> 00:21:57,250
Yuchuan

243
00:21:57,250 --> 00:22:00,290
Chiang’s here—with Zhou Qin.

244
00:22:00,290 --> 00:22:04,040
Something feels off.

245
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:06,000
His waist looks bulky.

246
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,290
He’s probably armed.

247
00:22:19,290 --> 00:22:20,420
Hey, Chiang.

248
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:25,420
Beautiful, why are you sitting next to a cockroach?

249
00:22:26,670 --> 00:22:32,750
Looks like Ma wants us to “talk.”

250
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:37,790
Or are we here to drink and dance?

251
00:22:37,790 --> 00:22:40,540
That works too.

252
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:50,630
ladies and gentlemen

253
00:22:50,630 --> 00:22:52,540
welcome to ACE

254
00:22:52,540 --> 00:22:54,380
thank you all for coming

255
00:22:54,380 --> 00:22:57,750
Please welcome our house performers—

256
00:22:57,750 --> 00:22:59,880
with a special show for you.

257
00:24:05,290 --> 00:24:07,920
Let’s hear it for our performers.

258
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:10,130
Now, let’s officially begin—

259
00:24:10,130 --> 00:24:14,290
our annual VIP X Party.

260
00:24:20,540 --> 00:24:21,670
Qin.

261
00:24:47,420 --> 00:24:49,790
Lin, wait for me.

262
00:24:49,790 --> 00:24:51,540
I will.

263
00:24:51,540 --> 00:24:52,670
I’ll be right back.

264
00:25:15,750 --> 00:25:16,670
Come with me.

265
00:25:31,630 --> 00:25:33,420
Since you’re both here—

266
00:25:33,420 --> 00:25:35,250
let’s talk about—

267
00:25:35,250 --> 00:25:37,880
the diamonds causing all this trouble.

268
00:25:41,790 --> 00:25:43,670
Uncle Ma

269
00:25:43,670 --> 00:25:47,500
Looks like this is bothering you.

270
00:25:48,380 --> 00:25:51,290
I’m the one bothered,

271
00:25:51,290 --> 00:25:53,170
Okay?

272
00:25:53,170 --> 00:25:54,420
You two—

273
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:57,040
do you even understand the situation?

274
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:58,170
Those diamonds should be with me.

275
00:25:58,170 --> 00:25:59,500
And now?

276
00:25:59,500 --> 00:26:01,040
They’re gone.

277
00:26:01,040 --> 00:26:02,920
Instead I’m here watching men dance.

278
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:04,630
Why don’t you go dance?

279
00:26:09,130 --> 00:26:11,420
Pan Hao

280
00:26:11,420 --> 00:26:14,420
You took what wasn’t yours.

281
00:26:14,420 --> 00:26:17,040
That’s on you.

282
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:19,000
Hand them over.

283
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:21,420
We call it even.

284
00:26:21,420 --> 00:26:24,790
Clean slate.

285
00:26:24,790 --> 00:26:26,170
Fair enough?

286
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:32,790
Uncle Ma, I really want to return them—

287
00:26:32,790 --> 00:26:35,920
and make things right.

288
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,250
But...

289
00:26:38,290 --> 00:26:41,540
Cut to the chase

290
00:26:41,540 --> 00:26:42,790
Where are the diamonds?

291
00:26:44,380 --> 00:26:46,000
The diamonds...

292
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:51,290
Sun Rourou took them.

293
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,670
What do you mean?

294
00:27:02,670 --> 00:27:05,040
Ah-jun almost stole them before.

295
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:06,000
So for safety—

296
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,420
I put them—

297
00:27:07,420 --> 00:27:10,790
in her safe.

298
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:14,500
I didn’t expect—

299
00:27:14,500 --> 00:27:18,040
she’d run off with them.

300
00:27:23,420 --> 00:27:27,290
Did you try contacting her?

301
00:27:27,290 --> 00:27:29,130
Checked her usual spots?

302
00:27:29,130 --> 00:27:32,630
I’ve been looking all day.

303
00:27:32,630 --> 00:27:34,250
She vanished.

304
00:27:34,250 --> 00:27:35,880
Come out, Pan Hao!

305
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:36,790
Excuse me

306
00:27:36,790 --> 00:27:38,290
Pan Hao, get out here!

307
00:27:43,670 --> 00:27:45,170
Sun Rourou…

308
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,170
I'll ...

309
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:59,880
What you’re holding—

310
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:03,790
should be what we’ve been looking for, right?

311
00:28:25,540 --> 00:28:27,880
Do you know these diamonds are fake?

312
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:39,540
You’re saying—

313
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:41,290
they’re fake?

314
00:28:41,290 --> 00:28:42,920
I was going to sell the diamonds

315
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:44,790
while Pan Hao was away—

316
00:28:44,790 --> 00:28:47,420
but the appraiser said they were fake.

317
00:28:47,420 --> 00:28:49,170
That’s why I’m here—to settle this with him.

318
00:28:49,170 --> 00:28:50,790
What are you talking about?

319
00:28:50,790 --> 00:28:52,170
You stole my diamonds—

320
00:28:52,170 --> 00:28:53,040
and now you show up—

321
00:28:53,040 --> 00:28:55,540
Your diamonds?

322
00:28:57,170 --> 00:29:00,130
Those belong to F.T. Crew.

323
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:06,420
So, F.T. Crew.—

324
00:29:06,420 --> 00:29:08,790
were playing us?

325
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:10,790
Using fakes in a deal with me?

326
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:13,630
How do I know you didn’t switch them yourself?

327
00:29:15,170 --> 00:29:17,540
Thief crying “thief.”

328
00:29:19,670 --> 00:29:24,380
Brother Yu, Brother Chiang—let’s calm down.

329
00:29:24,380 --> 00:29:26,420
Since the diamonds are fake anyway—

330
00:29:26,420 --> 00:29:28,670
no need to escalate this.

331
00:29:28,670 --> 00:29:30,290
Cut the act.

332
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:41,040
You punk—

333
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:42,670
you'd better—

334
00:29:42,670 --> 00:29:45,670
hand over the real diamonds.

335
00:29:45,670 --> 00:29:46,380
Or else—

336
00:29:46,380 --> 00:29:48,670
Even if you kill me right now—

337
00:29:48,670 --> 00:29:51,130
I still can’t get you the real ones.

338
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,500
Okay...

339
00:30:07,540 --> 00:30:09,130
That was wild tonight.

340
00:30:09,130 --> 00:30:10,420
Did you see those ladies?

341
00:30:10,420 --> 00:30:14,500
They were ready to eat us alive.

342
00:30:14,500 --> 00:30:15,670
You should’ve stayed and let them.

343
00:30:15,670 --> 00:30:17,040
I was thinking the same.

344
00:30:20,380 --> 00:30:21,540
Something’s happening in the main hall.

345
00:30:21,540 --> 00:30:23,540
Two groups are fighting.

346
00:30:26,170 --> 00:30:27,880
That looks really bad.

347
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:29,380
I’m going to help.

348
00:30:29,380 --> 00:30:30,670
Wait—what can you do?

349
00:30:30,670 --> 00:30:31,670
They’ve got guns.

350
00:30:31,670 --> 00:30:32,790
You gonna fight with that?

351
00:30:32,790 --> 00:30:34,250
Or block bullets with your abs?

352
00:30:34,250 --> 00:30:35,170
Well, if you put it that way—

353
00:30:35,170 --> 00:30:36,670
sounds like we’re useless.

354
00:30:36,670 --> 00:30:37,670
Let’s observe first.

355
00:30:37,670 --> 00:30:38,630
They’ve got guns.

356
00:30:38,630 --> 00:30:39,540
If someone gets hurt—

357
00:30:39,540 --> 00:30:40,420
we can call emergency.

358
00:30:40,420 --> 00:30:41,670
You can transform, right?

359
00:30:41,670 --> 00:30:43,040
I transform to block bullets?

360
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:44,290
We can’t just sit here.

361
00:30:44,290 --> 00:30:46,130
You’ll just end up dead.

362
00:30:46,130 --> 00:30:48,130
Calm down.

363
00:30:48,130 --> 00:30:49,670
Call the police.

364
00:30:49,670 --> 00:30:51,420
We’ll only get in the way.

365
00:30:53,380 --> 00:30:55,250
Calm down. Stop it.

366
00:31:11,170 --> 00:31:12,670
Baby

367
00:31:12,670 --> 00:31:13,750
Baby, look—

368
00:31:13,750 --> 00:31:15,290
our plan worked perfectly.

369
00:31:32,290 --> 00:31:33,920
I ordered take-out delivery for you.

370
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,420
It’ll be here soon.

371
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:41,500
Here—

372
00:31:41,500 --> 00:31:45,380
keep it on you for protection

373
00:31:45,380 --> 00:31:47,040
While I’m gone—

374
00:31:47,040 --> 00:31:49,000
be careful.

375
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:52,000
If anything happens—

376
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:54,000
call me immediately.

377
00:31:56,880 --> 00:32:00,290
Take the diamonds and hide.

378
00:32:00,290 --> 00:32:02,420
Don’t let anyone find you.

379
00:32:02,420 --> 00:32:06,130
When Uncle Ma sets the meeting—

380
00:32:06,130 --> 00:32:07,750
I’ll contact you.

381
00:32:11,670 --> 00:32:13,170
Then what?

382
00:32:13,170 --> 00:32:14,920
Bring the fake diamonds—

383
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:17,000
to look for me.

384
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:21,170
Call me out in public.

385
00:32:21,170 --> 00:32:23,170
That way—

386
00:32:23,170 --> 00:32:25,750
we'll shift the blame—

387
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:27,630
away from us.

388
00:32:41,290 --> 00:32:44,250
Rourou, it’s okay. I’ve got you.

389
00:32:45,170 --> 00:32:46,670
It's okay...

390
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:57,040
Last night, at a well-known male host club—

391
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,040
ACE Club—

392
00:32:58,040 --> 00:32:59,420
A well-known male host club—

393
00:32:59,420 --> 00:33:01,040
a gang shootout broke out.

394
00:33:01,040 --> 00:33:02,630
Gunfire erupted, throwing the scene into chaos.

395
00:33:02,630 --> 00:33:04,920
Several civilians were left shaken.

396
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:06,670
Police responded immediately.

397
00:33:06,670 --> 00:33:09,170
The area was secured and suspects were arrested.

398
00:33:09,170 --> 00:33:11,920
Liu Yu, leader of F.T. Crew—

399
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:13,000
is currently on the run.

400
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:14,540
Police are making every effort to pursue him.

401
00:33:14,540 --> 00:33:15,790
And this case

402
00:33:15,790 --> 00:33:18,670
further implicates Chao De-chiang, head of A.D.S.,

403
00:33:18,670 --> 00:33:20,420
he's suspected in multiple land acquisitions,

404
00:33:20,420 --> 00:33:21,920
violent extortion incidents

405
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:24,290
Authorities have launched a formal investigation.

406
00:33:24,290 --> 00:33:26,420
Chao De-chiang was taken in for questioning

407
00:33:26,420 --> 00:33:29,170
He's been remanded in custody without contact.

408
00:33:29,170 --> 00:33:30,750
Let's look at the earlier news

409
00:33:30,750 --> 00:33:33,040
Police say they have solid evidence—

410
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:35,630
linking Chao to multiple violent debt collections.

411
00:33:35,630 --> 00:33:37,920
This latest shootout at ACE—

412
00:33:37,920 --> 00:33:39,290
further confirms his direct ties—

413
00:33:39,290 --> 00:33:42,040
to organized criminal activity.

414
00:33:42,040 --> 00:33:45,170
Prosecutors have requested detention without contact.

415
00:33:45,790 --> 00:33:48,540
The key figure behind exposing the case—

416
00:33:48,540 --> 00:33:51,500
turns out to be A.D.S.'s lawyer, Lee Xiaozhen.

417
00:33:51,500 --> 00:33:53,290
She secretly gathered extensive evidence—

418
00:33:53,290 --> 00:33:54,420
and handed it over to the police,

419
00:33:54,420 --> 00:33:56,500
leading to these arrests.

420
00:33:57,630 --> 00:34:00,040
Earlier today, coordinated searches were conducted—

421
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:01,000
and suspects were taken in.

422
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,130
The latest update—

423
00:34:02,130 --> 00:34:03,960
the court has approved detention without contact.

424
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:07,210
A direct link to multiple criminal activities.

425
00:34:07,210 --> 00:34:09,330
Prosecutors have requested detention without contact.

426
00:34:32,790 --> 00:34:33,750
Look at these four.

427
00:34:33,750 --> 00:34:35,130
Bottom shelf?

428
00:34:35,130 --> 00:34:36,540
Or top shelf?

429
00:34:38,630 --> 00:34:41,500
Pick one. Your call.

430
00:34:41,500 --> 00:34:44,290
Come on, be serious!  Look at these two…

431
00:34:45,420 --> 00:34:47,170
Welcome!

432
00:34:47,170 --> 00:34:49,670
Cheers!

433
00:34:52,670 --> 00:34:53,790
Congrats, Boss Chang.

434
00:34:53,790 --> 00:34:56,290
Your own club at last.

435
00:34:56,290 --> 00:34:59,040
How do you feel?

436
00:35:00,750 --> 00:35:04,040
Amazing!

437
00:35:04,790 --> 00:35:06,920
Tony

438
00:35:08,170 --> 00:35:09,790
Quick announcement—

439
00:35:09,790 --> 00:35:12,380
To serve our high-energy crowd—

440
00:35:12,380 --> 00:35:16,130
we’re going—

441
00:35:16,130 --> 00:35:18,380
24/7

442
00:35:19,670 --> 00:35:22,790
What is this, a convenience store?

443
00:35:22,790 --> 00:35:24,000
Top-tier service,

444
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:25,420
anytime

445
00:35:25,420 --> 00:35:27,670
is my mission!

446
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:35,170
Officer, back at the station—how is it?

447
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:38,000
We’re done undercover.

448
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,500
Now working on phone scams.

449
00:35:40,500 --> 00:35:41,630
It's okay

450
00:35:41,630 --> 00:35:44,170
Need a hacker?

451
00:35:44,170 --> 00:35:45,630
How about me?

452
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:49,170
I’m great at… acquiring evidence.

453
00:35:50,540 --> 00:35:51,420
Watch your wording.

454
00:35:51,420 --> 00:35:54,540
That’s illegal.

455
00:35:54,540 --> 00:35:55,420
If you need a lawyer—

456
00:35:55,420 --> 00:35:57,000
I can lend you mine—

457
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:59,920
personal counsel.

458
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:01,170
Discount included.

459
00:36:02,630 --> 00:36:05,290
I really owe you this time.

460
00:36:05,290 --> 00:36:07,000
If it weren’t for you—

461
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:10,420
I couldn’t have taken Chiang down this smoothly.

462
00:36:10,420 --> 00:36:11,670
Thank you.

463
00:36:11,670 --> 00:36:13,790
No need to thank me.

464
00:36:13,790 --> 00:36:16,170
Frankly...

465
00:36:16,170 --> 00:36:18,500
I’ve been waiting for this day.

466
00:36:20,170 --> 00:36:25,170
My ex-husband died in a gang power struggle.

467
00:36:25,170 --> 00:36:28,790
Chiang sacrificed him

468
00:36:28,790 --> 00:36:30,670
for power—

469
00:36:32,130 --> 00:36:33,750
I never thought

470
00:36:33,750 --> 00:36:35,670
they could be that cruel.

471
00:36:35,670 --> 00:36:37,920
So I made up my mind—

472
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:39,130
no matter what it takes,

473
00:36:39,130 --> 00:36:41,040
I’d bring him to justice.

474
00:36:49,040 --> 00:36:52,380
No wonder when I secretly dug into your files—

475
00:36:52,380 --> 00:36:55,000
trying to clear Lee Xun’s name—

476
00:36:55,670 --> 00:36:57,540
you already knew

477
00:36:57,540 --> 00:37:00,420
but you didn’t expose me.

478
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:02,790
I thought

479
00:37:02,790 --> 00:37:04,750
I was just that good.

480
00:37:05,630 --> 00:37:06,670
You wish.

481
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:08,000
Obviously.

482
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:09,790
Still, I didn’t expect

483
00:37:09,790 --> 00:37:13,380
this shootout to go public.

484
00:37:13,380 --> 00:37:15,540
Feels like fate planned it.

485
00:37:17,040 --> 00:37:20,130
Cheers

486
00:37:20,130 --> 00:37:22,540
Cheers

487
00:37:28,290 --> 00:37:29,880
By the way—

488
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,540
anyone know how Pan Hao’s doing?

489
00:37:48,630 --> 00:37:50,290
Haitai, I’m taking off!

490
00:37:50,290 --> 00:37:52,170
Enemy encountered during take off

491
00:37:52,170 --> 00:37:53,290
Enemy encountered…

492
00:37:59,290 --> 00:38:02,920
Baby, listen—

493
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:04,790
I’ve been through this before.

494
00:38:04,790 --> 00:38:07,000
We’re safest staying here.

495
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,420
You see…

496
00:38:08,420 --> 00:38:10,170
It’s chaos out there.

497
00:38:11,630 --> 00:38:12,750
Yu’s still on the run.

498
00:38:12,750 --> 00:38:14,000
The situation is tense

499
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:16,920
Here we’ve got food and shelter—

500
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:18,670
Three meals a day

501
00:38:18,670 --> 00:38:20,880
plus late-night snacks.

502
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:21,790
No one chasing us,

503
00:38:21,790 --> 00:38:24,040
no one messing with us.

504
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:25,880
It’s basically paradise.

505
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:27,170
Right?

506
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,130
And

507
00:38:29,130 --> 00:38:30,540
honestly,

508
00:38:30,540 --> 00:38:32,000
I’ve been thinking—

509
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:35,750
maybe we should stay long-term.

510
00:38:37,880 --> 00:38:39,630
You’ve got some nerve.

511
00:38:45,670 --> 00:38:48,790
Can you appraise this batch?

512
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:55,000
Baby

513
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:56,540
Listen,

514
00:38:56,540 --> 00:38:57,880
once we get the money,

515
00:38:57,880 --> 00:39:01,040
we fly to Thailand and find David.

516
00:39:01,040 --> 00:39:03,130
You’ve got your passport, right?

517
00:39:30,750 --> 00:39:33,500
These are synthetic crystals.

518
00:39:40,750 --> 00:39:42,040
Are you sure?

519
00:39:43,750 --> 00:39:45,630
Then where are the real ones?

520
00:39:56,040 --> 00:39:58,540
When were the diamonds switched?

521
00:39:58,540 --> 00:40:00,670
You didn’t even notice?

522
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,040
Chenghan—

523
00:40:11,040 --> 00:40:12,420
what’s your plan now?

524
00:40:12,420 --> 00:40:16,380
Thought you wanted to open a boxing gym?

525
00:40:16,380 --> 00:40:17,790
I’ll go with the flow.

526
00:40:17,790 --> 00:40:19,540
After all...

527
00:40:19,540 --> 00:40:21,380
I’m not alone anymore.

528
00:40:23,040 --> 00:40:26,290
oh….

529
00:40:26,290 --> 00:40:27,500
Miss Lin—

530
00:40:27,500 --> 00:40:28,500
You’re still so devoted to Chenghan.

531
00:40:28,500 --> 00:40:30,790
Nothing’s changed, huh?

532
00:40:31,920 --> 00:40:34,290
Maybe he reminds me of

533
00:40:34,290 --> 00:40:37,290
a stray puppy.

534
00:40:37,290 --> 00:40:39,790
How am I like that?

535
00:40:39,790 --> 00:40:41,130
Shake hands

536
00:40:41,130 --> 00:40:42,790
Hey, wait—

537
00:40:42,790 --> 00:40:47,250
that’s a weird comparison.

538
00:40:47,250 --> 00:40:50,040
I have everything my life

539
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:53,000
Money, resources, choices—

540
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:54,630
but I’ve never felt

541
00:40:54,630 --> 00:40:56,540
truly needed.

542
00:40:56,540 --> 00:40:58,000
And you—

543
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:01,040
you never ask for anything,

544
00:41:01,040 --> 00:41:05,170
yet I can’t help but care about you.

545
00:41:05,170 --> 00:41:07,170
Maybe that’s what

546
00:41:07,170 --> 00:41:09,250
makes me feel

547
00:41:09,250 --> 00:41:12,130
like I actually matter.

548
00:41:19,420 --> 00:41:20,290
Alright—

549
00:41:20,290 --> 00:41:21,920
Here's

550
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,500
to all of us—

551
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:25,750
each with our own worth.

552
00:41:25,750 --> 00:41:27,170
Cheers

553
00:41:27,170 --> 00:41:28,000
Cheers

554
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,920
Cheers

555
00:41:30,790 --> 00:41:32,670
Oh right—

556
00:41:35,250 --> 00:41:36,170
that night at the X Party—

557
00:41:36,170 --> 00:41:38,420
didn’t Pan Hao say the diamonds were fake?

558
00:41:38,420 --> 00:41:39,920
So where are the real ones?

559
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:20,540
Not bad. Clean moves.

560
00:42:20,540 --> 00:42:22,250
Solid turns.

561
00:42:23,790 --> 00:42:27,920
But it lacks a bit

562
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:30,040
lethality

563
00:42:31,420 --> 00:42:34,670
A.D.S. is never short of nice moves.

564
00:42:34,670 --> 00:42:36,790
From now on,

565
00:42:36,790 --> 00:42:39,250
I want impressive results

566
00:42:42,500 --> 00:42:44,750
Ms. Qin, everything’s in place.

567
00:42:44,750 --> 00:42:47,790
All the other branches are also waiting for your call.

568
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,420
Time for a new choreography.

569
00:43:32,170 --> 00:43:34,290
Weren’t you filming in Thailand?

570
00:43:36,790 --> 00:43:38,630
Damn, you almost had me fooled.

571
00:43:38,630 --> 00:43:40,170
Even signed a contract.

572
00:43:43,790 --> 00:43:44,790
Must’ve been tough.

573
00:43:44,790 --> 00:43:46,540
Memorizing all those lines.

574
00:43:46,540 --> 00:43:48,790
Me? I didn’t act at all.

575
00:43:48,790 --> 00:43:51,540
Still got paid.

576
00:43:51,540 --> 00:43:53,420
Easy peasy

577
00:44:29,670 --> 00:44:31,540
Experience wins.

578
00:44:33,420 --> 00:44:35,290
